Purpose of the fork
-------------------
The upstream harness drives a SteVe CSMS. This copy keeps the scenario
specifications and the OCPP-J assertion engine verbatim and replaces only
the CSMS-facing driver, so the same certification scenarios can be run
against a different CSMS.

